# Current Source of Truth First

Authority order when sources disagree:

```text
Product Charter
→ docs/architecture/source-of-truth-index.md
→ current architecture / current implementation
→ current tests
→ historical specs / docs
```

CURRENT Source of Truth defines protected functionality.

Historical, superseded, archived, compatibility-only, deprecated, and explicitly
retired behavior is NOT automatically protected by No-Regression or E2E rules.

When a test contradicts current Source of Truth, treat the test as potentially
stale — do not bend implementation back to superseded architecture.

Canonical product model:

```text
Wizard: Connect → Sample & Record Selection → Destinations → Route Processing → Deploy
Runtime: Route Processing ON only (GDC_ROUTE_PROCESSING_ENABLED canonical true)
Architecture: One Stream → Many Routes → Many Destinations
```
